response.answer:
Simply put, BCIT staff must personally:

- assess your questionnaire and competitive ranking;
- verify your criminal record, immunization, CPR, and clinical-safety documents;
- confirm that you meet all conditions before final acceptance and clinical placement.

[See the program requirements](https://www.bcit.ca/programs/nursing-bachelor-of-science-in-nursing-full-time-8875bsn/)

